- DoublyLinkedList.insertAtFront(node) : Takes a RideRequest node and inserts it at the front of the list. Returns nothing.
- DoublyLinkedList.insertAtTail(node) : Takes a RideRequest node and inserts it at the tail of the list. Returns nothing.
- DoublyLinkedList.remove(node) : Takes a RideRequest node and removes it from the list. Returns nothing.
- DoublyLinkedList.toArray() : Converts the linked list to an array of RideRequest nodes in order. Returns an array.
- Sorting.mergeSort(arr, comparator) : Takes an array and a comparator function, sorts the array using merge sort. Returns the sorted array.
- Trie() : Initializes an empty Trie data structure with a root node. Returns a Trie instance.
- Trie.insert(key, ride) : Takes a string key and a RideRequest object, inserts it into the Trie. Returns nothing.
- Trie.search(prefix) : Takes a string prefix, searches for matching rides in the Trie. Returns an array of matching RideRequest objects.
- MinHeap.push(item) : Takes an object with rideId and expirationTime, adds it to the heap. Returns nothing.
- MinHeap.pop() : Removes and returns the smallest expirationTime item from the heap. Returns the removed item or null if empty.
- MinHeap.peek() : Returns the item with the smallest expirationTime without removing it. Returns the item or null if empty.
- MinHeap.heapifyDown(index) : Adjusts the heap structure starting from a given index to maintain heap order. Returns nothing.
- RideManager.addRide(ride) : Takes a RideRequest object, adds it to the ride system (Map, priority queue, Trie, and heap). Returns nothing.
- RideManager.removeRide(ride) : Takes a RideRequest object and removes it from the system. Returns nothing.
- RideManager.changePriority(ride, newPriority) : Takes a RideRequest object and a new priority, updates the ride’s priority and moves it to the queue. Returns nothing.
- RideManager.getAllActiveRides() : Retrieves all active rides from priority queues. Returns an array of RideRequest objects.
- RideManager.rideComparator(driverLocation) : Sorts rides based on priority, distance, and wait time from a driver’s location. Returns a sorted array of rides.
- RideManager.updateWaitTimes() : Updates wait times for all active rides based on the current time. Returns nothing.
- RideManager.updateRidePriority(ride) : Adjusts ride priority based on wait time. Returns nothing.
- RideManager.checkExpirations() : Removes expired rides from the system. Returns nothing.
- RideManager.assignRideToDriver(driverLocation) : Takes a driver’s location, finds, assigns, and removes the best ride based on priority and distance. Returns the assigned RideRequest or null if no ride is available.
